      <p>{"All rows below use the four-CPU host on October 17, 2026. Source versions, observation time, sample counts and the memory budget differ. The earlier b7157f6 single observations at 10 MB and 50 MB were lower than the new medians. They remain visible. The difference between these production series does not isolate a code regression or improvement. The local-build control above keeps the hardware and budget constant."}</p>
