      <p>{"The JSON Formatter Online shortcut probe could fold inner nodes without collapsing the root. Later scheduled visits inspect and use an actual visible root fold control if offered. Shortcut failures are not evidence that no folding exists. The JSON Beautifier collapse adapter initially had no probe. One corrected 1 MB visit and the first 10 MB visit found no Linux fold-all binding. Later scheduled visits also look for a visible line-1 fold widget. The download preserves the actual control evidence. These probe limits are not converted into a product-wide claim that folding is absent."}</p>
